  "description": "A comprehensive suite of cryptographic implementations and cryptanalysis tools focusing on both classical and modern primitives. The repository includes solvers for monoalphabetic substitution ciphers, modular arithmetic implementations of RSA and ElGamal, and Elliptic Curve Cryptography (ECC) systems. It further demonstrates practical application through an encrypted chat architecture utilizing hybrid cryptosystems with AES-CBC and ElGamal.",
